  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/998f160bb370a33810f810c8ac3b60c9fdb02187\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"529\" height=\"472\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/998f160bb370a33810f810c8ac3b60c9fdb02187\" data-origin-width=\"1370\" data-origin-height=\"1223\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>뜨거운 음료를</p><p>어느 쪽으로 마실 때 덜 뜨겁죠?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그 이유를</p><p>과학적으로 설명해보고,</p><p>이를 검증할 수 있는 실험설계를 해보세요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래의 AI설명은 fact일까요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3bdea50ad89b159d2b9542a014d96fa34878760\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"575\" height=\"464\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3bdea50ad89b159d2b9542a014d96fa34878760\" data-origin-width=\"718\" data-origin-height=\"579\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>다시 한 번&#160;</p><p>뚜껑을 관찰합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10a5860a751357fcdeafcdbcade361ea08a99c0c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"407\" height=\"387\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/10a5860a751357fcdeafcdbcade361ea08a99c0c\" data-origin-width=\"912\" data-origin-height=\"868\"></div><p>(나의 가설)</p><p>용액이</p><p>구멍에서 흘러 나오면서</p><p>플라스틱 뚜껑을 지나도록 설계됨.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>프라스틱으로 열이 전도되면서&#160;</p><p>용액의 온도가 내려가기 때문이다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>선생님 생각은 어떠세요?</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}